                    "message": "as /motherboard(/chassis, /tod_battery) EEPROM wont be having system VPD details from VSYS and also common interfaces from system config JSON doesn't have \"SubModel\" we don't need this entry for these paths."
                },
                {
                    "file": "configuration/ibm/correlated_properties_76002000.json",
