                        "username": "branupama"
                    },
                    "message": "Lets say even if motherboard EEPROM contains VSYS record for some reason, then destinationInventoryPath should be [\"/motherboard\", \"/tod_battery\"] and interface&property should be \"com.ibm.ipzvpd.VSYS\":\"BR\" to sync all correlated paths.\n\nsame for below paths as well (only in case motherboard eeprom holds \"VSYS\" record for RBMC type system)."
